WEBVTT

00:01:39.330 --> 00:01:40.210
Look here.

00:01:43.430 --> 00:01:45.110
Close your eyes.

00:02:11.180 --> 00:02:11.950
Thank you.

00:02:12.620 --> 00:02:13.420
Uh.

00:03:10.150 --> 00:03:12.930
Did something happen?

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:14.270
I'm sure.

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:17.150
She's been in
a foul mood lately.

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:21.960
Let her be.
Godai will be back today.

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:25.650
He's not going to stay
at the cabaret any more?

00:03:25.930 --> 00:03:27.270
That's what I heard.

00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:30.920
He's probably missing
his own place by now.

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:35.090
When he comes back, let's
hear what he's got to say.

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:44.870
Thank you for letting me
stay for so long.

00:03:45.810 --> 00:03:47.650
Sure. You're welcome anytime.

00:03:47.890 --> 00:03:54.180
You can even work here
forever if you like.

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:56.550
Bye.

00:04:00.490 --> 00:04:01.210
Hey!

00:04:02.210 --> 00:04:05.110
I'd stick to just one girl
if I were you.

00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:09.170
You don't have what it takes
to handle two women at once.

00:04:09.550 --> 00:04:12.640
Yes.  Thanks.

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:34.690
I don't intend to have
two women at once.

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:38.780
But I guess Kozue
still has feelings for me.

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:00.480
I'm back!

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:07.760
Hi. Sorry I've
been away for a while.

00:05:08.460 --> 00:05:10.190
Welcome back.

00:05:15.650 --> 00:05:16.530
Um..

00:05:17.010 --> 00:05:17.520
Yes?

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:20.270
N-Nothing.

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:34.840
That was rather curt.

00:05:42.830 --> 00:05:47.660
Come on in and take advantage
of our limited time offer!

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:59.070
C'mon, Godai. Drink up!
It's been a while.

00:05:59.390 --> 00:06:00.710
Thanks.

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:03.540
Godai!

00:06:04.390 --> 00:06:06.440
So what're you quarreling
about this time?

00:06:07.060 --> 00:06:08.840
Who's quarreling?

00:06:09.660 --> 00:06:11.590
D-E-N-I-A-L?

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:20.850
You can always tell by the
look on the manager's face.

00:06:23.010 --> 00:06:25.270
Why would Manager and I...?

00:06:25.470 --> 00:06:28.830
That's what we want to know.

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:31.470
Tell us the truth.

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:35.880
We're not quarreling.

00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:39.010
A quarrel would
be pointless.

00:06:39.390 --> 00:06:41.710
if Godai has no clue.

00:06:57.510 --> 00:07:00.000
All right! Fess up!!

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:02.640
I really didn't do anything.

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:06.100
Then why would
Manager be like that?

00:07:06.390 --> 00:07:07.270
If you don't tell us,

00:07:07.350 --> 00:07:09.380
we're going to send you
back to the cabaret.

00:07:09.630 --> 00:07:10.910
Please!

00:07:11.260 --> 00:07:14.380
Maybe she caught you
with another woman?

00:07:18.940 --> 00:07:23.000
She couldn't have
been watching...?!

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:40.170
Godai, you have a
phone call from Kozue.

00:07:50.290 --> 00:07:53.080
I hope you weren't busy.

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:55.290
It's okay. I don't
start work until evening.

00:07:56.230 --> 00:07:56.890
Good.

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:08.400
About the other day.

00:08:09.150 --> 00:08:11.010
Oh, you mean what I wanted
to talk to you about?

00:08:11.080 --> 00:08:12.270
You can forget it.

00:08:13.280 --> 00:08:16.120
It's something I have to
decide on my own, anyway.

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:18.710
That's not what
I was referring to...

00:08:18.780 --> 00:08:20.750
Someone proposed to me.

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:24.040
I'm supposed to give him
an answer tonight.

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:29.320
Did that surprise you?

00:08:30.430 --> 00:08:31.650
A little.

00:08:32.840 --> 00:08:35.500
I didn't know you
were seeing someone.

00:08:37.040 --> 00:08:39.340
So have you decided
on your answer?

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:47.140
The truth is, I was unsure.

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:49.610
I was thinking
about saying yes.

00:08:50.520 --> 00:08:53.150
But since you kissed me.

00:08:53.520 --> 00:08:55.250
"I" kissed you?!

00:08:56.060 --> 00:08:58.120
so I...

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:00.180
You're going turn him down?

00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:08.690
Godai, when will you find out if
you've passed your graduation exams?

00:09:08.840 --> 00:09:10.660
At the end of next month.

00:09:12.540 --> 00:09:16.560
I'm sorry. I'm not sure
if I should turn him down.

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:20.270
So I've decided
to ask him to wait

00:09:20.550 --> 00:09:23.040
until you get
your test results.

00:09:24.820 --> 00:09:27.520
I'm sorry.
I'm being selfish.

00:09:28.360 --> 00:09:31.350
No, it's me.

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:51.300
There's something
I need to tell you.

00:09:53.720 --> 00:09:57.540
I should have told you
before it got to this point

00:09:59.520 --> 00:10:01.360
But after I graduate,

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:05.280
there's someone
I want to propose to.

00:10:09.240 --> 00:10:14.420
So please don't make him
wait for your answer.

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:21.880
I understand.

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:25.940
I'll turn him down!

00:10:28.490 --> 00:10:31.040
You're making me cry.

00:10:31.680 --> 00:10:35.200
I couldn't tell, because
you're always so vague.

00:10:36.630 --> 00:10:40.720
I had no idea you
wanted to propose to me.

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:45.050
Thank you. I'm so happy!

00:10:46.880 --> 00:10:49.530
Oh, no!
I'm going to be late!

00:10:50.070 --> 00:10:52.480
I have to go.

00:10:52.650 --> 00:10:53.570
Wait!

00:10:56.650 --> 00:10:57.660
Wait!

00:10:57.780 --> 00:10:58.940
Sir, your bill!

00:11:01.860 --> 00:11:03.070
Kozue!

00:11:44.790 --> 00:11:45.680
I'm home.

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:57.000
I saw you.

00:11:59.810 --> 00:12:01.480
Why did you kiss her?

00:12:03.440 --> 00:12:05.400
Please answer me, Godai.

00:12:21.540 --> 00:12:23.520
Why did you kiss Kozue?

00:12:25.770 --> 00:12:27.470
You don't even feel
like making an excuse?

00:12:32.240 --> 00:12:35.540
Will you listen to
everything I have to say?

00:12:36.720 --> 00:12:37.900
Let's hear it.

00:12:38.420 --> 00:12:40.440
So... What happened was.

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:41.350
well...

00:12:42.560 --> 00:12:44.180
That wasn't a mutual thing.

00:12:44.430 --> 00:12:45.880
A surprise attack,
if you will

00:12:46.060 --> 00:12:48.320
So what made you do it?

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:49.320
SHE kissed ME!

00:12:52.260 --> 00:12:55.220
And you call yourself a man?
You're blaming Kozue?

00:12:56.070 --> 00:12:57.110
I'm just telling you
the truth!

00:12:59.100 --> 00:13:00.570
Oh, so your
relationship is such

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:02.330
that she can kiss you
anytime she wants.

00:13:03.900 --> 00:13:06.130
Never mind. I don't
want to hear any more.

00:13:06.220 --> 00:13:07.870
What do you mean,
"never mind"?!

00:13:08.420 --> 00:13:10.680
Excuses, excuses.
I'm sick and tired of them.

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:13.710
You're the one who asked.

00:13:14.420 --> 00:13:16.240
So you're in love
with Kozue.

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:20.130
It shouldn't matter
what I think of that!

00:13:20.330 --> 00:13:21.290
That's right!

00:13:21.930 --> 00:13:25.370
Anyway, why should I
have to explain myself?

00:13:26.130 --> 00:13:29.390
It's not like you
and I are lovers.

00:13:37.680 --> 00:13:38.500
You're right.

00:13:39.350 --> 00:13:41.710
I should just
keep my mouth shut

00:13:42.720 --> 00:13:44.970
because it's none
of my business.

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:52.080
Manager, please look
into my hands.

00:13:53.220 --> 00:13:54.320
For what?

00:13:54.700 --> 00:13:55.680
Just look.

00:13:57.570 --> 00:13:58.610
Here. Look inside.

00:14:03.600 --> 00:14:05.650
Close your eyes.

00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:10.840
Your eyes?

00:14:11.310 --> 00:14:12.170
Why?

00:14:12.350 --> 00:14:13.440
Because...

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:20.270
Look!

00:14:20.560 --> 00:14:21.240
Sure!

00:14:21.560 --> 00:14:22.720
Close your eyes!

00:14:22.930 --> 00:14:23.580
Sure!

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:31.150
Maybe I'm just stupid...?

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:41.540
You fell for something
this dumb?

00:14:42.240 --> 00:14:43.040
Yup

00:14:43.850 --> 00:14:44.770
How stupid.

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:48.860
Sure. I'm stupid.

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:06.650
Close your eyes.

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:26.140
You thought I was going
to kiss you, didn't you?

00:15:30.590 --> 00:15:31.810
Turn around.

00:15:33.220 --> 00:15:35.320
Turn your back to me.

00:15:38.260 --> 00:15:39.790
Then close your eyes.

00:16:11.990 --> 00:16:14.720
Really. You are a sucker.

00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:38.190
All right!!

00:16:55.100 --> 00:16:57.200
I Feel a little better now.

00:17:06.150 --> 00:17:08.350
Since I made her
take that step,

00:17:08.760 --> 00:17:12.280
It's my turn to take
the initiative. Right.

00:17:14.450 --> 00:17:16.880
I'm going to turn him down!

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:19.330
I have to do something.

00:17:19.740 --> 00:17:23.800
I need to see her
tomorrow and tell her.

00:17:25.370 --> 00:17:27.000
How could you?!

00:17:27.240 --> 00:17:30.100
I turned him down
because you proposed to me!

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:33.360
I'm sorry.
You misunderstood!

00:17:33.610 --> 00:17:35.370
How could you
do this to me?!

00:17:36.550 --> 00:17:38.630
Kyoko is the
only one for me.

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:39.750
Bing bong.

00:17:40.990 --> 00:17:43.510
You seem quite troubled.

00:17:44.150 --> 00:17:47.350
I'd be happy to lend an ear.

00:17:47.730 --> 00:17:49.490
M-Mind your own business!

00:17:49.770 --> 00:17:51.730
And don't come in here
unless you have a reason to.

00:17:52.240 --> 00:17:55.350
Oh, but I do.

00:17:55.740 --> 00:17:57.000
What?

00:17:57.310 --> 00:18:01.130
Are you coming to the party
tonight at Chachamaru?

00:18:02.280 --> 00:18:03.430
Party?

00:18:03.700 --> 00:18:07.330
I didn't think you heard.
It's a New Year's party.

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:09.310
I asked the manager
to tell you.

00:18:09.990 --> 00:18:11.250
I see.

00:18:12.790 --> 00:18:16.350
I'll be there. I'll
try to leave work early.

00:18:16.490 --> 00:18:20.510
So you and Manager made up?

00:18:20.890 --> 00:18:22.180
You could say that.

00:18:29.860 --> 00:18:31.060
Another hard day at work?

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:32.330
Thanks.

00:18:36.280 --> 00:18:39.010
Master! Another
bottle on Godai!

00:18:39.410 --> 00:18:42.320
Master! The bottle's empty!

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:45.670
Here's a new one.

00:18:45.790 --> 00:18:47.610
Another bottle here, too!

00:18:47.820 --> 00:18:48.340
Sure!

00:18:48.830 --> 00:18:51.260
Isn't it nice
that you made up?

00:18:52.030 --> 00:18:57.590
Godai, Manager's eyes started
to sparkle when you came in.

00:18:59.390 --> 00:19:00.150
Please.

00:19:00.570 --> 00:19:03.730
This means you'll get to stay
at Maison Ikkoku for a while.

00:19:03.960 --> 00:19:04.730
Of course.

00:19:05.010 --> 00:19:06.960
Never mind! Drink!

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:08.190
Three glasses!

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:09.930
Here. Bottoms up!

00:19:10.200 --> 00:19:12.540
Or Manager can't
serve you more.

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:13.900
Okay.

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:48.510
C'mon, Godai! Dance with me!

00:19:48.590 --> 00:19:50.170
I need to use the toilet.

00:19:50.490 --> 00:19:52.080
Dance before you go.

00:19:52.150 --> 00:19:54.520
Young girls! Young girls!

00:19:54.590 --> 00:19:56.700
The difference is
in their skin!

00:19:58.500 --> 00:20:00.790
Let me join you.

00:20:01.000 --> 00:20:03.260
Sure! Let's go!

00:20:04.420 --> 00:20:06.380
I need to use the toilet!

00:20:06.690 --> 00:20:09.030
You'll be fine!
You'll be fine!

00:20:10.700 --> 00:20:13.190
Hello there. Come in.

00:20:20.370 --> 00:20:21.630
Kozue?!

00:20:22.610 --> 00:20:25.050
Kentaro told me
you'd be here.

00:20:25.710 --> 00:20:26.870
What's the matter?

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:28.480
I...

00:20:29.650 --> 00:20:30.990
I couldn't.

00:20:33.530 --> 00:20:37.480
I couldn't turn
down his proposal.

00:20:39.240 --> 00:20:40.100
Godai!

00:20:40.160 --> 00:20:41.760
Kozue?!

00:20:46.670 --> 00:20:48.430
Calm down.

00:20:48.510 --> 00:20:54.000
But..! But you proposed
to me, Godai!

00:21:03.450 --> 00:21:04.820
Manager?

00:21:16.660 --> 00:21:17.560
What's wrong?

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:20.920
Godai, you don't need
to use the toilet?

00:21:22.480 --> 00:21:24.600
Kozue, wait here.

00:21:25.520 --> 00:21:26.280
Godai?

00:21:26.670 --> 00:21:28.860
Kyoko! It's all
a misunderstanding!

00:21:28.940 --> 00:21:30.240
Listen to me!

00:21:31.110 --> 00:21:33.550
I've had it! I don't
even want to see your face!

00:21:33.850 --> 00:21:35.210
I can explain.

00:21:35.620 --> 00:21:39.060
Go away! Get out
of Maison Ikkoku!

00:21:46.840 --> 00:21:48.740
I'm not moving out.

00:21:49.660 --> 00:21:50.640
Move out!

00:21:50.740 --> 00:21:51.850
No, I won't!

00:21:52.630 --> 00:21:55.120
What're you doing?

00:21:55.310 --> 00:21:57.630
Kozue's crying.

00:21:58.480 --> 00:22:01.810
Go ahead. She's crying
about you, isn't she?

00:22:02.050 --> 00:22:06.070
Please listen to me.
I'll tell you everything.

00:22:06.290 --> 00:22:07.940
I told you, I've had enough!

00:22:12.060 --> 00:22:14.520
I've done nothing to
deserve to be kicked out.

00:22:15.030 --> 00:22:17.420
I'm not moving out. Never.

00:22:19.890 --> 00:22:21.350
How dare you!

00:22:22.400 --> 00:22:24.070
I should never
have kissed you.

00:22:25.580 --> 00:22:27.900
Fine. If that's how
you want to play,

00:22:28.310 --> 00:22:30.030
I have a plan of my own.

00:23:11.380 --> 00:23:13.010
We're leaving, Soichiro.

00:23:22.160 --> 00:23:28.620
I'm not moving out,
Manager. I won't go.

00:23:50.190 --> 00:23:51.580
She won't come back?

00:23:51.750 --> 00:23:53.450
She won't even see me.

00:23:53.520 --> 00:23:56.040
She must be determined.

00:23:56.130 --> 00:23:59.980
I heard Mr. Otonashi's coming
here about a new manager.

00:24:00.700 --> 00:24:04.260
Next: Kyoko Retires!
Ikkoku, A Distant Memory?

00:24:04.380 --> 00:24:06.100
What'll we do?!
